#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:9
msgid ""
"In this Masterclass, we will discuss how to perform and analyze multi-"
"replica simulations where the different replicas feel different bias "
"potentials. We will also learn how to compute statistical errors on the "
"computed quantities."
msgstr ""
"この Masterclass では、各 Replica に異なる BiasPotential を加える Multi-replica "
"シミュレーションの実行・解析と、計算した量の統計誤差の求め方を学びます。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:11
msgid "Objectives"
msgstr "到達目標"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:13
msgid "Once you have completed this Masterclass you will be able to:"
msgstr "この Masterclass を終えると、次のことができるようになる。"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:15
