#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:70
msgid ""
"Throughout this tutorial we will run simulations of alanine dipeptide in "
"vacuum using GROMACS and PLUMED. Whereas this system is too simple to be "
"considered a proper benchmark for enhanced sampling methods, it is complex "
"enough to be used in learning about them. Notice that, although PLUMED has a"
" portable interface, the support for replica-exchange simulations is limited"
" and depends on the specific molecular dynamics engine that you have patched"
" with plumed. You should check the documentation of the MD code you are "
"using to know if replica exchange simulations will work correctly with "
"PLUMED."
msgstr ""
"この Tutorial では GROMACS と PLUMED で真空中の Alanine Dipeptide "
"をシミュレーションします。Enhanced Sampling 法の本格的な Benchmark には単純すぎますが、学習には十分複雑です。PLUMED "
"の Interface は移植性がありますが、Replica Exchange 対応は限定的で、Patch した MD "
"エンジンに依存します。正しく動くかは、使う MD コードのドキュメントを確認してください。"

